## VECTOR 3: WEB-TO-TV STREAM CONVERSION & VOD DELIVERY

---

**CRITICAL ERROR — No Range Request Support Headers in CloudFront Response Policy**

- HTTP Range requests (`Range: bytes=0-`) are the backbone of video scrubbing, fast-forward, and resume-play on every device from Chrome to Samsung TVs to Fire Sticks. CloudFront must explicitly pass `Range` headers to origin AND return the correct response headers. Without this, a Roku or Apple TV client requesting byte range 50MB into a 500MB MP4 will either fail or force a full download restart. Add an Origin Request Policy and Response Headers Policy:

```yaml
VODOriginRequestPolicy:
  Type: 'AWS::CloudFront::OriginRequestPolicy'
  Properties:
    OriginRequestPolicyConfig:
      Name: !Sub 'FixyachipsVODOriginRequest-${AWS::StackName}'
      Comment: 'Forward Range and Origin headers for VOD byte-range serving'
      HeadersConfig:
        HeaderBehavior: whitelist
        Headers:
          - 'Origin'
          - 'Access-Control-Request-Headers'
          - 'Access-Control-Request-Method'
          - 'Range'              # CRITICAL for video scrubbing
      CookiesConfig:
        CookieBehavior: none
      QueryStringsConfig:
        QueryStringBehavior: none

VODResponseHeadersPolicy:
  Type: 'AWS::CloudFront::ResponseHeadersPolicy'
  Properties:
    ResponseHeadersPolicyConfig:
      Name: !Sub 'FixyachipsVODResponseHeaders-${AWS::StackName}'
      Comment: 'CORS + security headers for VOD delivery'
      CorsConfig:
        AccessControlAllowCredentials: false
        AccessControlAllowHeaders:
          Items: ['*']
        AccessControlAllowMethods:
          Items: [GET, HEAD, OPTIONS]
        AccessControlAllowOrigins:
          Items:
            - 'https://fixyachips.com'
            - 'https://www.fixyachips.com'
        AccessControlExposeHeaders:
          Items:
            - 'Content-Length'
            - 'Content-Range'    # CRITICAL: allows player to track position
            - 'ETag'
            - 'Accept-Ranges'   # CRITICAL: signals byte-range support to players
        AccessControlMaxAgeSec: 3600
        OriginOverride: false
      SecurityHeadersConfig:
        ContentTypeOptions:
          Override: true
        FrameOptions:
          FrameOption: DENY
          Override: true
        ReferrerPolicy:
          ReferrerPolicy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
          Override: true
        StrictTransportSecurity:
          AccessControlMaxAgeSec: 31536000
          IncludeSubdomains: true
          Preload: true
          Override: true
        XSSProtection:
          ModeBlock: true
          Override: true
          Protection: true
      CustomHeadersConfig:
        Items:
          - Header: 'Cache-Control'
            Value: 'public, max-age=2592000, immutable'
            Override: false
```

