- **FINOPS SAVINGS — S3 CORS Allows POST and PUT on a CDN Read-Only Bucket**

`AllowedMethods: [GET, POST, PUT]` on a bucket that CloudFront reads from is incorrect and a security/cost exposure. CloudFront never POSTs or PUTs to S3 on behalf of video viewers. Strip to `[GET, HEAD]` as shown above. HEAD is required for byte-range negotiation on video players.

